{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>FaceIdent 是一款完全在裝置端運行的 AI 面部識別工具，能自動將相簿中的照片按人物進行分類與組織。這款應用適合希望高效管理大量生活照的用戶，現正提供終生版限時免費領取機會。</p>\n\n<h2>離線智能搜尋與分類</h2>\n<p>此 App 利用 Apple Neural Engine 技術，無需上傳雲端即可實現離線運行，確保私隱安全。它不僅能自動將照片中的人物與寵物分組，還支援語義搜尋，例如輸入「海邊的狗」或特定顏色、地點等關鍵詞，即可快速定位相關影像。此外，它能發現人際關係網絡，讓用戶直觀檢視親友圈及間接聯繫，將混亂的相機捲變成清晰的生活地圖。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-35-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-36-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-37-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-38-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-39-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-40-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>FaceIdent: AI Face Finder 終生版限時免費中，用戶點擊兌換連結，看到限時免費即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<img alt=\"IMG 5405\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/IMG_5405-473x1024.webp\"/>\n<img alt=\"IMG 5403\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/IMG_5403-473x1024.webp\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：FaceIdent: AI Face Finder</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-02T16:44:00.741488+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":428,"images":8,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}